Seven year old Rudolph 'Blaze' Ingram ran 100 metres in 13.48 seconds. Suppose that:

- the runner who came second took $1\frac14$ times 13.48 seconds;
- the runner who came third took $1\frac12$ times 13.48 seconds;
- the runner who came fourth took $1\frac34$ times 13.48 seconds.

In this case, what is the total of the times taken by the four runners (in seconds)?
